	//[user 2026-08-04] bug-1356 - BA SKIN PACK (12 ALLIED models, zero overlap with the 76 above).
	//Band of Brothers officers, British regulars/paras/officer, a Polish para (a faction we had
	//nothing for), snow-camo Brits and a recon captain. The pack's own 4 shader names collided
	//with ours (bob45holster / lt_helmet / pvt_helmet / sgt_helmet) - THEIR copies are renamed
	//ba_* and their tiks retargeted, per the shader-isolation recipe, so our helmets are
	//untouched. The pack's 11 AXIS models are deliberately NOT shipped (separate design call).
